    "description": "The Streaming Subscriptions Downgrade API allows businesses to manage their subscription tiers effectively by facilitating downgrades for existing streaming services. This endpoint enables users to request a downgrade from a higher to a lower subscription level based on their current needs and budget. Typically utilized by account managers and billing operators, this API ensures a seamless transition while updating resource allocations and billing cycles accordingly. By providing a structured downgrade process, organizations can enhance customer satisfaction and retention.",
